      "answer": "Among the 12 North America West Event Nexus accounts, the split is:\n\nTaxonomy/search semantics problems\n- Arcadia Cloudworks \u2014 \u201csearch relevance degradation after taxonomy changes,\u201d with missing results, low-ranked relevant incidents, and playbook trigger misses after taxonomy v2.1 rollout [art_90991e25335f]\n- BlueHarbor Logistics \u2014 search relevance degraded after taxonomy rollout, with poor and duplicate search results [art_8b0063fbb3cb]\n- CedarWind Renewables \u2014 incident lookup relevance fell after a taxonomy update, with unrelated incidents returned and more manual triage [art_10f7e8b72e09]\n- Pacific Health Network \u2014 low-relevance search results and incorrect incident grouping after a taxonomy update, with misfiring runbook triggers tied to search semantics [art_4eccfd9dcf29]\n- Pioneer Freight Solutions \u2014 low-relevance matches after a taxonomy update, causing manual cross-referencing [art_3ba29fe1e026]\n\nDuplicate-action problems\n- Helix Assemblies Inc. \u2014 high rate of duplicate incident executions and repeated remediation playbook runs [art_0ac4efa5a0ff]\n- LedgerBright Analytics \u2014 duplicate incidents and missing deduplication across cross-system handoffs [art_8478ccd5b200]\n- LedgerPeak Software \u2014 duplicate incidents, automated actions, duplicate pages, and an idempotency mismatch after post-acquisition cutover [art_2f780acc1f96]\n- MedLogix Distribution \u2014 surge in duplicate incidents tied to cross-system handoffs and an idempotency key schema mismatch [art_87b096c2c2d3]\n- Peregrine Logistics Group \u2014 duplicate runbook executions and duplicate incident creation after systems consolidation [art_0927b1cbb7f4]\n- Pioneer Grid Retail LLC \u2014 duplicated remediation runs and duplicated incidents, with suspected idempotency key mismatch after integration of AcquiBill v2 topics [art_f64972a66eeb]\n\nBoth\n- HelioFab Systems \u2014 reports both missed dedupe matches and irrelevant search results after a taxonomy update [art_9345d5653840]\n\nThat covers all 12 retrieved accounts in the North America West Event Nexus cohort, and the cohort enumeration is complete and authoritative [art_90991e25335f][art_8b0063fbb3cb][art_10f7e8b72e09][art_9345d5653840][art_0ac4efa5a0ff][art_8478ccd5b200][art_2f780acc1f96][art_87b096c2c2d3][art_4eccfd9dcf29][art_0927b1cbb7f4][art_3ba29fe1e026][art_f64972a66eeb]",
